{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The new Discover Weekly algorithm is actually getting better at finding obscure indie tracks I love. It feels like it really understands my taste now."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Great music library, but the app crashes on my Android phone every few days. If they fix the stability issues, I'd be a full promoter."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "I like the podcasts, but the audio quality is inconsistent compared to the music. Sometimes it sounds muffled, which is annoying during my commute."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "Best streaming service out there. The family plan is affordable, the catalog is huge, and the offline downloads work flawlessly on my phone."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "The price hike was a big letdown. I'm still here because of the music, but I'm seriously considering switching to Apple Music for the better integration with my iPhone."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Terrible customer support. I've been locked out of my account for three weeks and no one has responded to my emails. Unacceptable."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "It's fine. The music is good, but the ads on the free tier are too intrusive. I'm on the premium plan, but I still feel like I'm paying for a subpar experience sometimes."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "The new UI is much cleaner and easier to navigate. I can find my playlists and recent plays so much faster now. Great update."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "Bluetooth connection drops constantly when I'm in my car. It's so frustrating that I have to keep reconnecting. Ruins the driving experience."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Too many ads. Even with premium, I feel like they're pushing sponsored content too hard. The shuffle feature also feels random and not based on my actual listening habits."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "Absolutely love it. The lyrics feature is a game changer for me, and the student discount makes it very affordable. Highly recommend to anyone."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "The music catalog is unmatched. I can find any song I want, even old jazz records. The app is smooth and fast on my tablet."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Good service overall, but the recommendation engine for podcasts is weak. It keeps suggesting things I've already listened to or that don't match my interests."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "Perfect. The audio quality is crisp, the app is stable, and the family plan works great for my household. No complaints at all."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "I miss the old interface. The new design is too cluttered for my taste. Also, the offline download limit is too restrictive for long trips."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "Love the new features like the sleep timer and the improved podcast player. It's become an essential part of my daily routine."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "The app keeps crashing when I try to switch between music and podcasts. It's a dealbreaker for me right now. I'm thinking of canceling."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Decent service. The music is good, but the price is getting high. I'd like to see more value for money, maybe better integration with smart home devices."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "Excellent. The new AI-powered playlists are spot on. It feels like Spotify knows me better than I know myself. Keep up the good work."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "Best in class. The catalog is vast, the app is reliable, and the customer support is responsive. I've been a subscriber for years and never looked back."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "Love it. The family plan is a great value, and the music quality is top-notch. The app is easy to use and rarely has bugs."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Good, but the ads are too frequent. I'm on the free tier, but it's getting hard to listen to music without interruptions. I might upgrade soon."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "Solid service. The music library is great, and the app is stable. I just wish the podcast section was more organized and easier to browse."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "The app is slow to load, and the search function is often inaccurate. It's frustrating to use, and I'm considering switching to a competitor."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "Horrible. The app crashed during a live event, and I couldn't get a refund. The customer support was unhelpful and rude. I'm canceling immediately."
    }
  ]
}
